ffmpeg-5.1-web.patch: WebAssembly entry points for FFmpeg 5.1 fftools.

Origin: a modified excerpt of FFmpeg n5.1.10 fftools/cmdutils.c,
fftools/ffmpeg.c, and fftools/ffprobe.c, adapting the Emscripten changes that
ffmpeg.wasm (https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm) carries in src/fftools
at commit f876f907c7e9b9bf51d4ed0b913a855a63ae63fc. Modified for
ii_ffmpeg_universal by Intelligent Iterations.

